(corpus-ch4-090)
*optimize a for vel=max on segment 1, trajectory 1
  constrain east[2] on segment 4 = east[1] on segment 7

  constrain east on segment 4, trajectory 2
    = east on segment 7, trajectory 1
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic
    long=0 lat=0 alt=0 vel=0 gama=0 psi=90 time=0 wt=1
  *segment 1 test
    *when time>1 stop
*end
